       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QTT14.
      * TRUST PARTY - ROLE AND INTEREST BANDS
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ROLE                   PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           88  ALWAYS-IDENTIFIED VALUES 'AUTHOR' 'TRUSTEE' 'CONTROLLER'.
       01  WS-INTEREST               PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           88  MATERIAL-INTEREST    VALUES 15.00 THRU 100.00.
       01  WS-IDENTIFY               PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-ROLE
           ACCEPT WS-INTEREST
           PERFORM 2000-PARTY
           DISPLAY 'IDENTIFY: ' WS-IDENTIFY
           STOP RUN.
       2000-PARTY.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-IDENTIFY
           IF ALWAYS-IDENTIFIED
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-IDENTIFY
           END-IF
           IF WS-ROLE = 'BENEFICARY' AND MATERIAL-INTEREST
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-IDENTIFY
           END-IF.
